  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnspacing=\"1.4ex\" columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> is continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math>,&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
